	(text
		""
		(at 18.79 206.9 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "35f465e4-eeb3-5c56-83b6-4c3eef5bae2f")
	)
	(text
		"J2 pin 1 F+, pin 2 S+, pin 3 S-, pin 4 F-. PT100 4-wire; force pair carries the 1 mA IDAC current, sense pair reads the RTD."
		(at 18.79 210.9 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "11259911-d3a9-51a9-bc13-66eba3adc74d")
	)
	(text
		"R_S1/R_S2 1k with C_D 100nF across the pair and C_CM1/C_CM2 10nF to AGND: differential corner 1/(2pi*2k*110nF) about 720 Hz, common-mode corner about 16 kHz."
		(at 18.79 213.44 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "3843a955-501c-59ff-855f-13fa2e04ebe4")
	)
	(text
		"C_D is 10x each C_CM so a capacitor mismatch turns into little differential error (TI input filter rule). C0G so the filter does not move the reading."
		(at 18.79 215.98 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "4d4ceb1f-904d-5b20-a66c-866f3333525c")
	)
	(text
		"C_F 10nF decouples the force node F+ (IDAC output). R_BIAS 1k returns the IDAC current to AGND and lifts the RTD common-mode to about 1.1 V."
		(at 18.79 218.52 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "08dec4b8-b3fe-522d-ada6-989e95e7682d")
	)
	(text
		""
		(at 17.87 120.475 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "a97a72e5-87ed-55ce-84ec-c272e7be284d")
	)
	(text
		"AVDD from +3V3A (ferrite-filtered), DVDD and IOVDD from +3V3. AVSS, AVSS_SW, REFN0, REFCOM, the exposed pad and DGND (pin 14) are on AGND: the ADC returns its own digital supply current to AGND and sits at the single tie. CLK is tied to that ground to use the internal oscillator."
		(at 17.87 124.475 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "c21605bc-f4ad-5fea-ba9c-57879644d5cc")
	)
	(text
		"REFOUT has 1 uF to AGND for the unused internal reference. RESET has a 10k pull-up to +3V3 and is also driven by the MCU."
		(at 17.87 127.015 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "cd872a46-00ef-5276-82f6-1ddcf668d68d")
	)
	(text
		"AINCOM, AIN3..AIN11, REFP1/REFN1, GPIOs and pin 25 are left open."
		(at 17.87 129.555 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "c10fdd0e-ecb4-58cb-914e-93566b35bd4a")
	)
	(text
		""
		(at 432.5 64.595 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "00c9bb0a-3617-554e-95c6-d751fdf4f432")
	)
	(text
		"REF5025 2.5 V, VIN from +3V3A, VOUT straight to REFP0 with 1 uF at the reference pin, GND to AGND. TEMP, TRIM/NR, DNC and NC pins are open."
		(at 432.5 68.595 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "66ce9ff5-ab18-5106-9b83-b2f1ae90adf3")
	)
	(text
		""
		(at 320.88 106.03 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "8c32fcea-0892-5e52-bf1c-3a7049b7a539")
	)
	(text
		"L2 filters +3V3 into the +3V3A analog rail for the ADC and the reference. Its DC resistance and the ADC/REF supply current are not computed here."
		(at 320.88 110.03 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "77b94853-b2dd-5b71-a7c8-8f26a88826f1")
	)
	(text
		""
		(at 18.62 352.95 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "055eb661-5a50-5918-b0ff-52d1c2e8339e")
	)
	(text
		"RP2350 runs from its on-chip regulator: VREG_VIN on +3V3, VREG_LX through L1 3.3uH to the 1.1 V DVDD net, VREG_FB on that net."
		(at 18.62 356.95 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "c54f84aa-0c0b-58c5-b023-bfc849dab933")
	)
	(text
		"VREG_AVDD and ADC_AVDD are fed from +3V3 through R_AV 33R and C_AVF 4.7uF."
		(at 18.62 359.49 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "6290c60e-24be-5ec2-9920-1e2a93934e41")
	)
	(text
		"U4 W25Q128 on the QSPI pins is the boot flash. Y1 ECS-120-20-33-TR 12 MHz, CL 20 pF: 2x 33 pF load caps (33/2 + about 3 pF stray = 19.5 pF), R_X 1k on XOUT."
		(at 18.62 362.03 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "5cde2070-7aba-5c8a-afce-391f28a606bf")
	)
	(text
		"J3 SWD: pin 1 SWCLK, pin 2 SWDIO, pin 3 DGND. RUN has a 10k pull-up to +3V3."
		(at 18.62 364.57 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b6318664-e9fc-5812-8981-ddc7bb7880a5")
	)
	(text
		""
		(at 319.61 213.25 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "02e85220-3a98-58bf-83a7-b281a335e13a")
	)
	(text
		"USB 2.0 device port, VBUS 5 V in. CC1/CC2 5.1k so a host sources 5 V. 27R series on D+/D-, ESD diodes at the connector."
		(at 319.61 217.25 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "bc2de50c-894f-522c-bab4-6f4b1981706c")
	)
	(text
		"VBUS feeds U5 LP5907-3.3 (250 mA) which makes the +3V3 digital rail. No VBUS fuse or TVS: see QUALIFICATION.md."
		(at 319.61 219.79 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "9cca6f1a-44bb-57d0-9697-012d339759a8")
	)
	(text
		"The RTD board is a bus-powered USB device: it draws a few tens of mA. No USB-C PD."
		(at 319.61 222.33 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "80ac5d4e-bbee-5313-9380-ea79e3a519ab")
	)
	(text
		""
		(at 319.4 44.34 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "538cd390-aeb1-53ff-97ac-30694d72bea4")
	)
	(text
		"R_TIE is the one and only AGND-DGND connection, next to U1. Remove it and the two grounds are open."
		(at 319.4 48.34 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "e71721b5-a566-5560-8328-9f1880cd7f5b")
	)
